<title>THAILAND: STA Group Q4 1996 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>STA Group Q4 1996 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fourth quarter to December 31, 1997.</p>
<p>		    (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				  1997			  1996</p>
<p>				    Fourth quarter</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss     32.06	vs  Loss	0.35</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss  1,603.10	vs  Loss     17.46</p>
<p>				    Twelve months</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)  Loss     48.32	vs  Loss	0.32</p>
<p>    Net	   Loss  2,416.17	vs  Loss     16.10</p>
<p>NOTE: Results are audited. STA Group (1991) Plc is a producer of rubber wood furniture.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
